    "description": {
      "content": "The public WordPress REST API exposed by EDDA Technology, Inc. at https://www.eddatech.com/wp-json/. It is the only public HTTP API surface EDDA publishes: EDDA's IQQA product line is regulated medical imaging software delivered on-premises to hospitals and does not ship a public developer API. This document was DERIVED by the API Evangelist enrichment pipeline from the live WordPress REST discovery document, restricted to routes verified to return 200 to anonymous callers. Write operations exist on the server but require authentication (WordPress application passwords) and are not documented here.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: EDDA Technology, Inc.",
